{"unit_id":"skyrocks__dsh-go-quota#card-zh","repo":"skyrocks/dsh-go-quota","commit":"13da18aa5ec462c3fe2718bb130e311d8266bc62","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@skyrocks/dsh-go-quota（DSH 网页客户端插件）：在对话输入框下方显示 OpenCode GO 账户的 5 小时、本周和本月用量。它通过 Host 服务读取 DSH 配置中的凭据引用并请求用量接口，再由客户端注册输入框 dock，展示百分比进度条、阈值颜色和重置倒计时。支持悬浮查看详情、点击或键盘操作刷新，并按当前模型提供方隐藏非 GO 用量条。适合需要随时查看 OpenCode GO 套餐额度的 DSH 用户；需要已配置的 GO 凭据和 OpenCode GO 账户。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:403-414","index.js:61-96"]}
{"unit_id":"skyrocks__dsh-go-quota#card-en","repo":"skyrocks/dsh-go-quota","commit":"13da18aa5ec462c3fe2718bb130e311d8266bc62","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@skyrocks/dsh-go-quota shows OpenCode GO five-hour, weekly, and monthly usage below the DSH composer. It reads a configured DSH credential, fetches usage, and displays percentage bars and reset details. Hover for details; click to refresh. The dock hides for other providers.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:403-414","index.js:61-96"]}
